{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221400","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322140001:1":{"text":"이게 마지막 전투야! 평화와 안식을 위한 영혼의 전투!","source_cn":"这是最后一场战斗！一场通往和平与宁静的灵魂之战！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51220CB3C4CA407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322140002:0":{"text":"전사들이여, 집결하라!","source_cn":"我的战士们，集合吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEB9FD9E06A49BC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322140003:1":{"text":"발리카... 장군님!","source_cn":"瓦丽卡……将军！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x427A7D176E465A7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322140004:1":{"text":"전사들이여, 얼음의 악마는 이미 봉인되었다. 그 전쟁에서... 우리가 이겼다!","source_cn":"战士们，冰之恶魔已经被封印，那场战争，我们——赢了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A8BF12A1C6BAC6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322140005:1":{"text":"이겼다고?\n...이겼다!!!","source_cn":"赢了？\\n……胜利了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38C9039E4CE0D90B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322140006:1":{"text":"오늘, 우리는 마지막으로 어깨를 나란히 하고 싸울 것이야. 이번 적은 우리 내면에 자리한 악의와 광기다.","source_cn":"今天，我们将最后一次并肩作战。这次我们的敌人是大家难以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15B597F062C8205E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322140007:1":{"text":"이게 마지막 전투야! 평화와 안식을 위한 영혼의 전투!","source_cn":"这是最后一场战斗！一场通往和平与宁静的灵魂之战！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51220CB3C4CA407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322140008:1":{"text":"여기서 이기면 우리는 빛과 따스함으로 가득한 미래에서 다시 만날 것이다!","source_cn":"赢下它！我们将会在充满光明和温暖的未来重逢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32C3B43953AB5473","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322140009:1":{"text":"장군님 밑에서 싸울 수 있어서... 영광입니다...","source_cn":"很荣幸……能在您麾下作战……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27185FA185F24443","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322140010:1":{"text":"발리카 장군님...","source_cn":"瓦丽卡将军……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58BFB3BC3DBF8307","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322140011:1":{"text":"여신이시여, 이 엄숙한 순간에 기도를 바칩니다... 슬픔이 밤을 지배할지라도, 평화는 새벽과 함께 찾아올 것이니...","source_cn":"女神啊，在这庄严的时刻，我们向您祷告……尽管悲伤在夜晚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3393311A73E28D49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322140012:1":{"text":"여신이시여, 은혜를 내려주소서. 죽음은 끝이 아니니, 그들을 당신의 나라로 인도하소서. 그곳에서는 모든 눈물을 닦고 영원한 안식에 들 수 있을 것입니다...","source_cn":"女神啊，赐予我们恩典，死亡不再是终结……让他们去往您的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACD968700DA04993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322140013:1":{"text":"영혼의 부름과 동시에 캐롤라이나의 따뜻한 목소리로 살아있는 시체들은 서서히 자아를 되찾고 광기를 억누르기 시작했다.","source_cn":"伴随着灵魂的召唤和卡列琳娜温柔的声音，活死人们渐渐找回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB315551176C35A41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1322140014:1":{"text":"오그리 수도사, 맥심 수도사! 정화를 시작하라!","source_cn":"奥格列修士、马克西姆修士，开始净化吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35F05C685DB42DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1322140015:1":{"text":"네, 발리카 님!","source_cn":"好的，瓦丽卡女士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x077299C35CC3DEDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1322140016:1":{"text":"두 수도사가 정화를 시작했다. 성스러운 빛 아래에서 일부 살아있는 시체들은 미소를 지으며 천천히 사라졌지만, 그 수가 많아 수도사들은 점차 지쳐갔다.","source_cn":"两位修士开始了净化。一些活死人在圣光的照耀之下，微笑着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB2D100AD5572A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1322140017:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 수도사들을 도와줘!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB1D7EB35924B1A69","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 수도사들을 도와줘!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 수도사들을 도와줘!","variant_male_record_index":"149434","variant_female_record_index":"149435","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:活死人战士":{"text":"살아있는 시체 전사","source":"活死人战士","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士奥格列":{"text":"수도사 오그리","source":"修士奥格列","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":5}}